<title>FINLAND: RAISIO '96 NET SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</title>
<headline>RAISIO '96 NET SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish foodstuffs, animal feed</p>
<p>and chemicals group Raision Tehtaat Oy on Thursday gave the</p>
<p>following breakdown of its 1996 net sales and operating profit</p>
<p>by division (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES					  1996	 1995</p>
<p> Foodstuffs					1,999	1,519</p>
<p> Animal Feeds					760	  742</p>
<p> Chemicals					 1,360	1,099</p>
<p> Inter-divisional				 -191	 -136</p>
<p> Consolidated				    3,928	3,224</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT				 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Foodstuffs					   74	   96</p>
<p> Animal Feeds					 24	   40</p>
<p> Chemicals					   101	   48</p>
<p> Other operations				   -3	   -1</p>
<p> Total						 196	  183</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
